{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25941","headline":"章华宫行 · 鲍溶","name":"章华宫行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟渚南鸿呼晓羣，章华宫娥怨行云。\n十二巫峯仰天禄，金车何处邀云宿。\n小腰婑堕三千人，宫衣水碧颜青春。\n岂无一人似神女，忍使黛蛾常不伸。\n黛蛾不伸犹自可，春朝诸处门常鏁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25941.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25941","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}